    "Spacetime Rifts follow a three-hour cycle, with eight published openings each day. Korea and Taiwan list 02:00, 05:00, 08:00, 11:00, 14:00, 17:00, 20:00 and 23:00 on their own service clocks. Choose the service you actually play before reading a countdown; the same clock label does not mean the same UTC instant.": "時空裂縫採三小時週期，每天公佈八個開啟時間。韓服與台服各自列出 02:00、05:00、08:00、11:00、14:00、17:00、20:00、23:00。請先選擇實際遊玩的服務；相同鐘點不代表相同的 UTC 瞬時。",
    "The timer separates the scheduled opening, the reported entry window and the estimated activity boundary. Taiwan’s official guide describes fifteen minutes for entry, while the Global and Korea reference uses a community-reported ten-minute window. The activity estimate is not your personal remaining stay, and portal capacity or maintenance can prevent entry.": "計時器分開呈現預定開啟、來源所述入場窗口及估計活動邊界。台服官方指南記載十五分鐘入口，國際服與韓服參考社群回報的十分鐘。活動估計不是個人剩餘停留時間；容量或維護也可能阻止入場。",
    "Global sources disagree about the clock behind the schedule. Shugo publishes service-local hours, MetaBot describes a shared UTC+9 clock, and Atlas uses UTC for Rifts. The latter two produce the same repeating Rift instants. Local-clock interpretations can diverge around daylight saving changes, so compare the source labels instead of assuming every region is confirmed.": "國際服來源對排程時鐘有分歧。Shugo 使用本服時間，MetaBot 描述共用 UTC+9 時鐘，Atlas 則以 UTC 列出裂縫時間。後兩者的重複裂縫瞬時相同。本服時鐘解釋可能在夏令時間切換時分叉，請比較來源，不要假設所有地區都已確認。",
    "Check the world map when an opening is scheduled, then confirm the available portal in game. Our location directory lists ten candidate zones across four maps, with five possible positions in each zone. The separate rewards table covers fourteen level-45 faction quests. Use those references alongside the reset checklist to prepare before you travel.": "預定開啟時請查看世界地圖，在遊戲中確認可用入口。位置目錄列出四張地圖的十個候選區域，每區五個可能位置。獎勵表則整理十四個 45 級種族任務；可搭配重置清單規劃出發前的準備。",
